  "techName_sbRegionLineConfinement": "Region trapped in a line",
  "@techName_sbRegionLineConfinement": {},
  "techWhy_sbRegionLineConfinement": "Every cell still open in region {regionIndex} lies in this {line} {lineIndex}. That region's {stars} star(s) therefore use up the whole quota of the line, so the rest of the line is empty.",
