  "techName_sbForwardElimination": "One step ahead",
  "@techName_sbForwardElimination": {},
  "techWhy_sbForwardElimination": "Suppose a star went at {cell}. It would black out its neighbours and close its row, column and region — and then some unit could no longer reach its own quota. So no star can go there.",
